<title>JAPAN: Moody's says upgrades Okuma to Ba3 from B1.</title>
<headline>Moody's says upgrades Okuma to Ba3 from B1.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Monday it had upgraded its long-term debt rating for Okuma Corp to Ba3 from B1.  </p>
<p>Moody's said the upgrade was due to Okuma's restructuring efforts, which had made the company more price-competitive.</p>
<p>Okuma Corp makes machine tools and industrial machinery.</p>
</text>
